  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is correct. Dividing each side of the given equation by <math alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"StartRoot 2 x EndRoot equals 4\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>. Squaring both sides of this equation yields <math alttext=\"2 x equals 16\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>16</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Multiplying each side of this equation by <math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"6 x equals 48\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>6</mn>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>48</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"6 x\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>6</mn>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"48\"><mn>48</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"3 x\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"6 x\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>6</mn>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"9 x\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>9</mn>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"6 x\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>6</mn>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext=\"12 x\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>12</mn>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"6 x\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>6</mn>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>",
